    5. On non-marked rows, place blue at each marked-col position with ~50-80% probability (these represent interrupted vertical line segments)
    6. Build input by replacing all red cells with black (undo the fill); blue stays
    7. Validate: every marked row/col has an adjacent blue pair; no non-marked row/col has one
